{"id": "coaching/07879ad2", "th": "8650fc17", "dur": 46.888, "scenes": [{"kind": "intro", "label": null, "heading": "Give every session the same backbone", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 8.817, "sents": [{"t0": 0.35, "t1": 2.16, "d": "Give every session the same backbone", "w": [0.35, 0.582, 1.005, 1.35, 1.576, 1.808]}, {"t0": 2.4, "t1": 8.817, "d": "Sessions without a shape feel pleasant and go nowhere. The same three part structure every time fixes that.", "w": [2.4, 2.838, 3.267, 3.529, 3.827, 4.115, 4.553, 4.833, 5.104, 5.617, 5.897, 6.186, 6.483, 6.772, 7.218, 7.743, 8.032, 8.443]}]}, {"kind": "point", "label": null, "heading": "Three movements, every session", "t0": 9.437, "t1": 17.852, "sents": [{"t0": 9.437, "t1": 14.291, "d": "Look back at what they committed to, work on what matters most now, then agree the next step.", "w": [9.437, 9.67, 9.902, 10.121, 10.354, 10.587, 11.04, 11.367, 11.6, 11.819, 12.052, 12.398, 12.631, 12.966, 13.199, 13.531, 13.757, 13.99]}, {"t0": 14.531, "t1": 17.852, "d": "Same shape every time, so clients feel forward motion.", "w": [14.531, 14.818, 15.113, 15.635, 16.056, 16.325, 16.638, 16.925, 17.351], "p": [[8, "🔁", "Same shape", "key"]]}], "ic": "🔁"}, {"kind": "point", "label": null, "heading": "Open with last week's promise", "t0": 18.472, "t1": 27.477, "sents": [{"t0": 18.472, "t1": 22.929, "d": "Read your notes, then ask directly how the thing they promised to do actually went.", "w": [18.472, 18.71, 18.948, 19.398, 19.636, 19.867, 20.321, 20.552, 20.782, 21.027, 21.265, 21.72, 21.943, 22.166, 22.621], "p": [[2, "👀", "Read notes first", "do"]]}, {"t0": 23.169, "t1": 27.477, "d": "That one question tells the client you remember, and makes commitments feel real.", "w": [23.169, 23.428, 23.68, 24.074, 24.342, 24.593, 24.869, 25.121, 25.739, 25.991, 26.361, 26.881, 27.141]}], "ic": "👀"}, {"kind": "point", "label": null, "heading": "Protect the final five minutes", "t0": 28.097, "t1": 37.885, "sents": [{"t0": 28.097, "t1": 32.82, "d": "Most sessions leak value when good discussion runs long and the tasks get rushed.", "w": [28.097, 28.388, 28.831, 29.122, 29.422, 29.714, 30.005, 30.58, 30.871, 31.163, 31.445, 31.728, 32.028, 32.31], "p": [[11, "📝", "Write the tasks", "do"]]}, {"t0": 33.06, "t1": 37.885, "d": "Stop the conversation yourself and write down two or three specific tasks with dates.", "w": [33.06, 33.336, 33.603, 34.272, 34.69, 34.957, 35.241, 35.516, 35.783, 36.042, 36.325, 36.852, 37.136, 37.411]}], "ic": "⏳"}, {"kind": "point", "label": null, "heading": "Take notes straight away", "t0": 38.505, "t1": 46.338, "sents": [{"t0": 38.505, "t1": 42.494, "d": "Across five or six clients, your memory of who said what blurs fast.", "w": [38.505, 38.892, 39.158, 39.407, 39.665, 40.08, 40.346, 40.838, 41.087, 41.345, 41.611, 41.876, 42.15]}, {"t0": 42.734, "t1": 46.338, "d": "Fill in a short template right after the call, while it is still fresh.", "w": [42.734, 42.96, 43.172, 43.378, 43.61, 43.953, 44.186, 44.508, 44.727, 45.059, 45.382, 45.594, 45.806, 46.039], "p": [[4, "🗒️", "Short template", "key"]]}], "ic": "🗒️"}], "take": "Look back, work the middle, then agree the next step in writing."}